sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Patient / Caller
    participant Voice as Voice Layer
    participant Agent as AI Agent Orchestrator
    participant Tool as Tool Dispatcher
    participant API as Clinic Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Caller->>Voice: "عايز ألغي ميعادي بكرة" ("Cancel my appointment tomorrow")
    Voice->>Agent: Text Transcript + Session Patient ID (101)

    Agent->>Tool: get_patient_appointments(patient_id=101, status_filter="scheduled")
    Tool->>API: GET /api/v1/patients/101/appointments?status=scheduled
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM appointments WHERE patient_id = 101 AND status = 'scheduled'
    DB-->>API: 1 Record: [Appt #501 with Dr. Sarah Farouk, Tomorrow at 14:00]
    API-->>Tool: HTTP 200 OK (Appointments List)
    Tool-->>Agent: Returns Active Appointment

    Note over Agent: MANDATORY CONFIRMATION GUARDRAIL:<br/>Must confirm before calling cancel_appointment.

    Agent->>Voice: Synthesize: "عند حضرتك ميعاد مع دكتورة سارة فاروق بكرة الساعة 2:00 بعد الضهر. متأكد إنك تحب تلغيه؟"
    Voice-->>Caller: Speaks Arabic Confirmation Prompt

    Caller->>Voice: "أيوه، إلغيه لو سمحت" ("Yes, cancel it please")
    Voice->>Agent: Confirmed Cancellation

    Agent->>Tool: cancel_appointment(appointment_id=501, reason="Patient request via voice")
    Tool->>API: DELETE /api/v1/appointments/501 {cancellation_reason: "Patient request via voice"}
    
    API->>DB: UPDATE appointments SET status = 'cancelled', cancellation_reason = '...', updated_at = NOW() WHERE id = 501
    DB-->>API: Rows Affected: 1
    API-->>Tool: HTTP 200 OK {id: 501, status: "cancelled"}
    Tool-->>Agent: Tool Success Envelope

    Agent->>Voice: Synthesize: "تم إلغاء ميعاد حضرتك بنجاح. تحب أساعدك في أي حاجة تانية؟"
    Voice-->>Caller: Speaks Cancellation Confirmation
